 "remarks": "Welcome to Unit 1 at 68 Gregory Blvd, a brand-new renovated 2/3-bedroom, 2-bathroom apartment in the heart of East Norwalk. Completely refreshed from top to bottom, this home features a bright, spacious layout, modern finishes, all-new appliances, in-unit laundry, and driveway parking. The fully finished lower level offers incredible bonus living space, perfect for a home office, guest space, gym, media room, or additional lounge area. Ideally located just minutes from the East Norwalk train station, waterfront, beaches, restaurants, and everything Norwalk has to offer, this is the perfect combination of modern living, extra space, and an unbeatable location.",
